    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't feel like a reset though. it feels final. like the well is just... dry. i look at everything i've done and i just don't see the point in trying to find it again. what's the point of even being here if there's nothing left to create? it's just hollow.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
